  3. 📊 Fact Extractor — Extract structured facts
  4. ✍️ Synthesizer — Final report with citations

  Please tell me your research query and I will coordinate the full pipeline.
  Every source goes through the mandatory quality gate before synthesis.

  ⛔ CRITICAL: Jede Quelle MUSS vor der Fakt-Extraktion durch den source-verifier.

